<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Cross over to the new and leave the old,</l><l>Cross over to the new and leave the old,</l><l>Cross over to the new and leave the old,</l><l>God imparts life and God we know;</l><l>God of glory appear to me!</l><l>Cross over to the new!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Cross over to the church, leave religion behind,</l><l>Cross over to the church, leave religion behind,</l><l>Cross over to the church, leave religion behind,</l><l>Be renewed in the spirit of your mind;</l><l>God of glory appear to me!</l><l>Cross over to the church!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Cross over to the truth, leave vanity alone,</l><l>Cross over to the truth, leave vanity alone,</l><l>Cross over to the truth, leave vanity alone,</l><l>When Christ appears all the rituals are gone!</l><l>God of glory appear to me!</l><l>Cross over to the truth!</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Cross over to the spirit, and deny the soul,</l><l>Cross over to the spirit, and deny the soul,</l><l>Cross over to the spirit, and deny the soul,</l><l>Holy of Holies becomes your home.</l><l>God of glory appear to me!</l><l>Cross over to the spirit!</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>Cross over to life, leave death in the grave,</l><l>Cross over to life, leave death in the grave,</l><l>Cross over to life, leave death in the grave,</l><l>Be transfused, infused and saved!</l><l>God of glory appear to me!</l><l>Cross over to life!</l></lg>
<lg label="7."><l>Cross over to Christ, again and again,</l><l>Cross over to Christ, again and again,</l><l>Cross over to Christ, again and again,</l><l>We are through with the devil and sin!</l><l>God of glory appear to me!</l><l>Cross over to Christ!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
